Z||000009||Haze_Performance||08-17-2000||05:54 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Homicidal:<BR><B>Love the rims.  And did you recently lower it?  How much does that job cost?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Thank You. Yes I lowered it. I had it done at a Merlin Muffler Shop (Naperville Illinois) for $60 labor (I supplied the Shocks, Struts and Springs) + $38 for a 4-wheel alignment  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> . Im VERY happy with the work they do. When I got the Exhaust they only charged me $309.00 (That was for a new Converter and full GT Exhaust)  <P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mycarsig.jpg"> My 1985 2M4 Sport Coupe<P><BR>My Website's  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/WS6_Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>WS6 Fiero</A> &                  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/HMP" TARGET=_blank>H.M.P. </A>||||reg||11
